Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1426.5,496.5)}舊友喜相逢
